The typst-library and typst-svg components have been modified to make
plugins, syntax highlighting, bibliographies, PDF import, and additional
raster decoders optional. This distribution enables all of them.
The fonts are unmodified: Libertinus Serif and DejaVu Sans Mono from
typst-assets 0.15.1, and STIX Two Math 2.13 from the STIX Fonts project;
see typst-fonts-NOTICE for their copyrights and licenses.
